---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Security" description="Vulnerability reporting and security practices">
	<section class="section">
		<div class="mono-label">Disclosure</div>
		<h1>Security</h1>
		<p class="intro">
			If you believe you've found a vulnerability or sensitive issue in this site, please report it
			responsibly. Helpful reports beat dramatic ones.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="section stack">
		<div class="content-card">
			<h2>Report a vulnerability</h2>
			<p>
				Email <a href="mailto:security@guetta.tech">security@guetta.tech</a> with reproduction steps,
				affected paths, and impact.
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Include the affected domain and endpoint.</li>
				<li>Avoid accessing data that is not yours.</li>
				<li>Give time for investigation before disclosure.</li>
			</ul>
		</div>

		<div class="content-card">
			<h2>Scope</h2>
			<p>
				Public endpoints on <code>guetta.tech</code> are in scope. Third-party services should be
				reported to their vendor.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="content-card">
			<h2>Responsible disclosure</h2>
			<p>
				Valid reports will be acknowledged. If a fix is required, we will prioritize remediation and
				share timing as clearly as possible.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="content-card" id="hall-of-fame">
			<h2>Hall of fame</h2>
			<p>
				Acknowledgments live in <a href="/.well-known/security.txt">security.txt</a>. This section
				will be expanded as reports come in.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.mono-label {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--text-3);
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}
	.intro {
		max-width: 38rem;
		font-size: 1.125rem;
	}
</style>
